  "<h2>🏅 {0} – {1}</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--muted)\">{2} XP{3} · {4} Ziele erreicht</p>\n    <div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:9px\"><i style=\"width:{5}%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#fde047)\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"rank-steps\">{6}</div>\n    <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Ziele · {7}</span></div>\n    {8}\n    {9}\n    <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">Prämie und XP gibt es sofort beim Erreichen; danach folgt ein neues Ziel. Jeder Tag bringt zusätzlich XP für Sicherheit, Pünktlichkeit und Gewinn. Höhere Ränge: mehr Vertragsangebote und Ansehen.</p>\n    <div class=\"modal-acts\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-x>Weiter</button></div>": "<h2>🏅 {0} – {1}</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--muted)\">{2} XP{3} · {4} goals reached</p>\n    <div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:9px\"><i style=\"width:{5}%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#fde047)\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"rank-steps\">{6}</div>\n    <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Goals · {7}</span></div>\n    {8}\n    {9}\n    <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">Bonus and XP are paid out as soon as you reach a goal; then a new goal follows. Each day also brings XP for safety, punctuality and profit. Higher ranks: more contract offers and reputation.</p>\n    <div class=\"modal-acts\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-x>Continue</button></div>",
