  "\n      <div class=\"p-head\">\n        <div class=\"p-title\">{0} Vorfeld-Leitstand <small id=\"gp-eff\"></small></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p-body\">\n        <div id=\"gp-alert\"></div>\n        <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Ankünfte · Parkpositionen{1}</span><span class=\"cnt\" id=\"gp-c-inb\">0</span></div>\n        <div class=\"toggle-row\"><span>Positionen automatisch vergeben</span><button class=\"switch\" id=\"gp-sauto\"></button></div>\n        <button class=\"btn gp-plan\" id=\"gp-plan\" title=\"Zeitstrahl aller Positionen – Ankünfte per Ziehen zuweisen (Taste G)\">{2} Positionsplan <kbd>G</kbd></button>\n        <div id=\"gp-inb\"></div>\n        <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Abfertigung (Turnaround){3}</span><span class=\"cnt\" id=\"gp-c-ta\">0</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gp-bar\"><button class=\"btn btn-good\" id=\"gp-all\" title=\"Alle gelben Aufgaben mit freien Fahrzeugen bedienen (Taste D)\">{4} Alles bedienen <kbd>D</kbd></button><small>Dringendste oben · Balken = Zeit bis TOBT, ▼ = voraussichtlich fertig</small></div>\n        <div id=\"gp-ta\"></div>\n        <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Fuhrpark · Auto-Disposition{5}</span></div>\n        <div class=\"fleet\" id=\"gp-fleet\"></div>\n        <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Tanklager &amp; Tankwagen{6}</span></div>\n        <div id=\"gp-fuel\"></div>\n      </div>": "\n      <div class=\"p-head\">\n        <div class=\"p-title\">{0} Apron Ops Desk <small id=\"gp-eff\"></small></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"p-body\">\n        <div id=\"gp-alert\"></div>\n        <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Arrivals · Stands{1}</span><span class=\"cnt\" id=\"gp-c-inb\">0</span></div>\n        <div class=\"toggle-row\"><span>Assign stands automatically</span><button class=\"switch\" id=\"gp-sauto\"></button></div>\n        <button class=\"btn gp-plan\" id=\"gp-plan\" title=\"Timeline of all stands – assign arrivals by dragging (key G)\">{2} Stand plan <kbd>G</kbd></button>\n        <div id=\"gp-inb\"></div>\n        <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Ground handling (turnaround){3}</span><span class=\"cnt\" id=\"gp-c-ta\">0</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gp-bar\"><button class=\"btn btn-good\" id=\"gp-all\" title=\"Serve all yellow tasks with free vehicles (key D)\">{4} Serve all <kbd>D</kbd></button><small>Most urgent at the top · bar = time to TOBT, ▼ = expected ready</small></div>\n        <div id=\"gp-ta\"></div>\n        <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Vehicle fleet · Auto-dispatch{5}</span></div>\n        <div class=\"fleet\" id=\"gp-fleet\"></div>\n        <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Fuel farm &amp; fuel trucks{6}</span></div>\n        <div id=\"gp-fuel\"></div>\n      </div>",
