  "<div class=\"p-sec\"><span>🚶 Sicherheitskontrolle</span><span class=\"cnt\">{0} Spuren</span></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"row\"><span class=\"t\">Wartezeit jetzt: <b style=\"color:{1}\">{2} min</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">heute max. {3} min</span></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">Andrang {4} Reisende/h · Kapazität {5}/h ({6} Spuren à 120)</div>\n      <div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:{7}%;background:{8}\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">Ab etwa 12 Minuten Wartezeit dauert das Boarding länger (Nachzügler), ab 20 Minuten sinkt das Ansehen. Jede Ausbaustufe „Sicherheitsspuren“ bringt zwei Spuren mehr.</div></div>": "<div class=\"p-sec\"><span>🚶 Security</span><span class=\"cnt\">{0} lanes</span></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"row\"><span class=\"t\">Wait now: <b style=\"color:{1}\">{2} min</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">today's peak {3} min</span></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">Demand {4} travellers/h · capacity {5}/h ({6} lanes × 120)</div>\n      <div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:{7}%;background:{8}\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">From about 12 minutes of waiting, boarding takes longer (stragglers); from 20 minutes, reputation drops. Each “Security lanes” expansion stage adds two more lanes.</div></div>",
