  "<div class=\"rv-grid\"><table class=\"rv-tab\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>{0}</th><th>{1}</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n    {2}\n    {3}\n    {4}\n    {5}\n    </tbody></table>\n    <div class=\"rv-fx\"><div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Auswirkungen</span></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">📨 Neue Airline-Angebote kommen <b>{6}</b></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">✍️ Vertragsverlängerungen <b>{7}{8} %</b></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">🏢 Abgeworbene Verbindungen: <b>{9}</b> · 🛬 übernommene Umleitungen: <b>{10}</b></div>\n      {11}\n      {12}\n      <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>So gewinnst du Anteile</span></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">Ansehen und Pünktlichkeit hochhalten, Entgelte nicht über {13} setzen, Positionen und Parallelbahn ausbauen. Abwerbeversuche mit Gegenangebot oder Service-Paket abwehren, Umleitungen bei Sperrungen annehmen.</div>\n    </div></div>": "<div class=\"rv-grid\"><table class=\"rv-tab\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>{0}</th><th>{1}</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n    {2}\n    {3}\n    {4}\n    {5}\n    </tbody></table>\n    <div class=\"rv-fx\"><div class=\"p-sec\"><span>Effects</span></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">📨 New airline offers arrive <b>{6}</b></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">✍️ Contract renewals <b>{7}{8} %</b></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">🏢 Routes poached: <b>{9}</b> · 🛬 Diversions taken in: <b>{10}</b></div>\n      {11}\n      {12}\n      <div class=\"p-sec\"><span>How to win market share</span></div>\n      <div class=\"s\">Keep reputation and punctuality high, don't set fees above {13}, build more stands and the parallel runway. Fend off poaching attempts with a counter-offer or service package, and accept diversions when the rival closes.</div>\n    </div></div>",
